      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.49 (vs ₹1.21 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.49 (up from ₹1.21 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹420.0m (up 8.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹16.8m (up 23% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.0% (up from 3.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 68% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 35% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
